<p class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Rentals</p>
<h1>50cc Motorbike Hanoi: Solo Travelers Choosing a 50cc</h1>
<p>Solo travel in Hanoi rewards independence, and a 50cc rental is the most independent machine in the shop. The verified rate for a 50cc scooter is 200,000 VND per day, our counter at 112 Nguyen Van Cu, Long Bien is open from 09:00 to 21:00 every day, and a small automatic scooter hands you the city one quiet street at a time, with no schedules, no group votes, and no passenger to balance. This page is for the rider traveling alone: how to decide whether the 50cc class fits you, how to run the fit checks without a second opinion, and how to plan routes, safety, and budget as your own guide.</p>
<p>It belongs to the <a href="/hanoi-50cc-motorbike-rental/">50cc motorbike rental hub for Hanoi</a> and sits beside our persona guides for short riders and lightweight riders. For every verified price in the lineup, see the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost overview</a>, and for rental terms in plain language, the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> collects the questions solo travelers ask us most at the counter.</p>
